flowchart LR
 subgraph Frontend
  ROUTES[Protected routes] --> FORMS[Role-aware forms and tables]
  FORMS --> CLIENT[API client with in-memory bearer]
 end
 subgraph Backend
  MW[Security middleware] --> AUTH[Auth router]
  MW --> OPS[Incident router]
  MW --> AUDIT[Evidence and finding routes]
  OPS --> CAPTURE[Canonical audit service]
  AUTH --> CAPTURE
  AUDIT --> VERIFY[Verification service]
  VERIFY --> CAPTURE
  CAPTURE --> PRISMA[Prisma]
 end
 CLIENT --> MW
 PRISMA --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
 WORKER[Background worker] --> DB
 WORKER --> ETH[Ethers registry adapter]
 VERIFY --> ETH
 ETH --> SOL[Solidity registry]
